\taxon{Remark}
\title{How we formulate the token--action boundary}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{agent}

\p{We formulate the action serializer to separate language-model generation
from environment execution. Section 2 of \citef{yao2023react} writes actions
and observations in a textual trajectory. The definition above makes the
parsing boundary explicit so that malformed calls, constrained grammars, and
environment actions can receive different semantics.}

\p{Later questions can therefore ask whether an improvement comes from better
reasoning, better serialization, or a more permissive parser.}
